1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,670
Hi guys, this is going to be my first thrift vlog, so we'll see how it goes.
大家好，这是我的第一支旧衣购物视频，看看会拍成什么样吧。

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:07,440
But it is 9:30 right now and I'm about to go thrifting.
现在是九点半，我准备去逛旧衣店。

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:19,550
But first we need to make a stop at the bank because this place I'm going to is cash only. So let's go.
不过得先去一趟银行，因为这家店只收现金。出发吧。

4
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,190
Okay, I just parked at the thrift store.
好，我刚在旧衣店这里停好车。

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:30,960
And some of those essentials that I love to always bring with me into the thrift are an Octobuddy for when I'm filming content and try ons, AirPods so I can listen to my own music.
每次逛店我都会带些必需品：拍内容和试穿时用的手机吸盘，还有听自己音乐的耳机。

6
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:37,160
And then a few snacks because I can be in there for up to three or four hours at a time, and also some water.
还会带些零食，因为我一次能在里面待三四个小时，另外还要带水。

7
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,960
So let's go. Okay, I'm so happy I discovered this store.
出发吧。真高兴发现了这家店。

8
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:43,760
It's Red White and Blue Thrift in Tampa, Florida, and it is so good.
这是佛罗里达坦帕的 Red White and Blue Thrift，我觉得很不错。

9
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:48,110
It's literally one of the best thrift stores I've been to, so if you have a store near you, I definitely recommend going.
这是我逛过最好的旧衣店之一，如果附近有分店，我很推荐去看看。

10
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:55,160
Anyways, the first rack I'm going to go to is the coat section because that's where I find all the fur coats or the puffer jackets with fur trim.
总之，先去外套区，在那儿能找到毛绒外套和带毛绒饰边的羽绒服。

11
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:57,200
It's honestly been my favorite recently.
最近我真的很喜欢这类衣服。

12
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:00,870
And I literally look at every single item on the rack, as you can see I'm doing here.
我真的会把衣架上每件都看过，就像画面里这样。

13
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:04,400
I've definitely gone faster at it since I've had so many years of thrifting at this point.
逛了这么多年，我翻找的速度确实快了不少。

14
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:09,480
But I think it makes such a big difference because so many things can be hidden if you don't look through it fully.
不过，我觉得仔细翻差别很大，不翻完整排就容易漏掉好东西。

15
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:14,000
Okay, and here I spotted my first find of the day. It's this blazer leather jacket.
这里发现了今天第一件心动单品，这件西装版型的皮夹克。

16
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,990
I first checked to make sure that it was real leather because I don't really like to buy faux leather.
我先确认是不是真皮，因为我个人不太喜欢买人造皮革。

17
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,000
It doesn't really have a lot of value, and the tag is usually found on the inside of the jacket like this.
她觉得人造皮革不太值；材质标签一般就在夹克内侧，像这样。

18
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,470
So this one was real and I put it in my cart.
这件是真皮，所以我放进了购物车。

19
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:27,840
Now I'm just continuing down the same rack and spotted my next find.
接着沿同一排继续翻，又有了下一个发现。

20
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:33,440
Oh my gosh, this one is a leather jacket, but it has the fur trim hood. Literally the cutest combo ever.
天哪，这件皮夹克还有毛绒饰边的帽子，搭配得好可爱。

21
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:39,440
Okay, I need to get a better tripod or something to hold up my phone because here I'm just balancing it on the racks across from me.
我需要一个好点的三脚架来固定手机，现在只能把它平衡放在对面的衣架上。

22
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:43,720
But this is me in real speed, how I go through the racks and look at everything.
这里是我翻衣架的实际速度，我就是这样逐件看的。

23
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:47,040
So honestly it does take a lot of time, but it pays off.
所以确实很花时间，但值得。

24
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:50,720
I'm really attracted to leather jackets right now, so I kind of pull out every one that I see.
我最近很喜欢皮夹克，看到一件就忍不住拿出来看看。

25
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:55,200
But this one was this biker style. I wasn't sure about it, but thought I would try it on later.
这件是机车风，我还没拿定主意，想晚点试试。

26
00:01:55,200 --> 00:02:00,040
But this one was 18, a bit more on the expensive side, so it's definitely more of a maybe.
这件标价十八，算偏贵一些，所以我还要考虑。

27
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:04,159
And I actually hit the leather jacket jackpot in this spot because there was three more right here.
这里简直是皮夹克宝藏区，旁边又有三件。

28
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:10,880
This first one had an interesting shape though. It was a bit of a longer fit and it had a belt, but I wasn't a huge fan of it, so I put it back.
第一件版型挺特别，是偏长款，还带腰带，但我不太喜欢，就放回去了。

29
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:16,400
But this next one, first I was checking the price and then checking for the tag to make sure it was authentic leather.
下一件我先看价格，再找标签确认皮革材质。

30
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:22,960
But the fit was actually so nice and it was in great condition, and it was only 10, so this was definitely going in the cart.
这件版型很好，保存状态也好，只要十，所以当然放进购物车。

31
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:31,480
And the last one in this spot was actually more of a shorter slimmer fit, but I actually liked the style, and this one was only 5, so I definitely got it.
这一排最后一件偏短偏修身，我挺喜欢，而且只要五，于是拿下了。

32
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:37,600
Okay, I'm still in the same aisle, but I started to go way faster because you can see there's a girl ahead of me and I wanted to grab all the good things.
我还在同一条过道，但越翻越快，因为前面还有人，我也想赶紧找到好东西。

33
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:43,600
But I literally found so many great coats here. Like this fur one is reversible. Literally so perfect.
这里真的找到好多漂亮外套，比如这件可以两面穿的毛绒外套，太喜欢了。

34
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:47,719
Then I spotted more fur, and this puffer jacket is the kind that I look for exactly.
接着又看见毛绒款，这件保暖外套就是我想找的类型。

35
00:02:47,719 --> 00:02:50,760
Like I love the fur trim hood and the more slimmer fit.
我很喜欢毛绒饰边的帽子和修身版型。

36
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:55,400
I stopped filming for the rest of this aisle so I could find everything more quickly, but I did find another fur coat.
这条过道剩下的部分我没拍，这样能翻得快点，不过又找到一件毛绒外套。

37
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:59,800
I headed to the purses next, and honestly I don't always have a lot of luck here, but it doesn't hurt to check.
接着去看包。我在这个区不总能淘到，但看看也无妨。

38
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:02,160
And the section small anyways, so it doesn't take long.
反正这个区很小，逛起来也不花太久。

39
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:06,680
But today I actually spotted this gorgeous cheetah print bag, and it was like a fleece cheetah material.
今天倒是发现一个很漂亮的猎豹纹包，材质有点像绒面。

40
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:13,640
But I thought it was so cute and Y2K aesthetic vibes, and I just love these colors and this print right now, so of course I got it.
我觉得它很可爱，很有千禧年代的感觉，最近就喜欢这些颜色和花纹，所以买了。

41
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,719
I didn't have much luck with any of the other bags though.
不过，其他包就没碰到太合适的。

42
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:21,480
This is how I look through them. I kind of just go through it quickly and wait to see if there's anything that stands out.
我会这样快速翻一遍，看看有没有特别吸引我的。

43
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:24,279
But I didn't see anything else besides this brown bag.
除了这个棕色包，我没看到其他心动的。

44
00:03:24,279 --> 00:03:30,400
I kind of like the more slouchy casual shape, but I thought it was too plain, so I ended up not getting it.
我有点喜欢它松弛随意的包型，但又觉得太素，最后还是没买。
